<title>USA: PHLX to list options on Big Flower Press.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list options on Big Flower Press.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Friday it would list options on Big Flower Press Holdings on October 9.</p>
<p>The options will open with strike prices of 10, 12-1/2 and 15, and expiration months of November, December, March and June, the PHLX said.</p>
<p>It said Susquehanna Investment Group will be the specialist.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>Email: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
